                "Autoclave O-8 at Decene-Fold DF-5 holds oligomer skin at 94 C, well below the 125 C "
                "freeze, with 1-decene already parked at 3.4 t/h inside a 6.0 t/h feed ceiling. "
                "Keeping that PAO make is lawful; a feed-encoder-led stop would shutter a quiet stack.",